WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.550
A birthday dinner starts with a conversation. FormBridge helps your restaurant look

00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:07.400
after everything that follows.

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:13.293
Four guests become six. A voice message moves dinner to after eight.

00:00:13.293 --> 00:00:18.100
The brief keeps the change, and asks for the exact time.

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:23.468
Ask the desk assistant for a warm reply, a follow-up and a

00:00:23.468 --> 00:00:27.400
note for the next shift. You choose what to keep.

00:00:28.050 --> 00:00:33.600
A birthday, a quiet table, a dietary request. Review the guest's words

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:35.450
before keeping each detail.

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:41.000
Save the enquiry to your team. Plan the service, find the follow-up

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.450
and give every request an owner.

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:48.900
Let guests ask questions, then check their details through a private review

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:49.300
page.

00:00:49.950 --> 00:00:56.126
Explore the connected handoff in simulation. No real table is reserved. Bring

00:00:56.126 --> 00:00:58.700
your own enquiries to FormBridge.
